# Main Mods

Tekkit Classic: Born Again is built around several major technology
and automation mods. These mods are designed to be used independently
or combined together into larger factories.

## Technology & Automation

### [Create](https://create.fandom.com/wiki/Create_Mod_Wiki)
Mechanical power, contraptions and automation.

### [BuildCraft Community Edition](https://minecraftbuildcraft.fandom.com/wiki/Minecraft_Buildcraft_Wiki)
Pipes, engines, quarries and classic BuildCraft automation.

### [IC2 Classic](https://wiki.industrial-craft.net/index.php?title=Main_Page)
EU power generation, machines, ore processing and nuclear technology.

### [ProjectE](https://ftb.fandom.com/wiki/Getting_Started_(ProjectE))
EMC-based transmutation and Equivalent Exchange gameplay.

### [Project Red](https://project-red.fandom.com/wiki/PROJECT_R.E.D.)
Redstone wiring, logic gates, machines and RedPower-inspired technology.

### [Applied Energistics 2](https://appliedenergistics.org/)
Digital storage networks and automated crafting.

### [Forestry: Community Edition](https://feed-the-beast.fandom.com/wiki/Forestry)
Automated farming, bees, genetics and renewable resources.

### [CC: Tweaked](https://tweaked.cc/)
Programmable computers and turtles.

### [Ad Astra](https://ad-astra-mod.fandom.com/wiki/Ad_Astra_Mod_Wiki)
Space exploration, rockets, planets and space technology.

### [Little Logistics](https://littlelogistics.murad.dev/guide-legacy.html)
Train Tug Logistics 
